sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Gateway
    participant FeatureStore
    participant ScoringEngine
    participant AuditStream

    User->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/action
    Gateway->>ScoringEngine: Evaluate Risk (account_id, context)

    par Fetch Features
        ScoringEngine->>FeatureStore: Get velocity & history features
        FeatureStore-->>ScoringEngine: Feature vectors
    end

    ScoringEngine->>ScoringEngine: Supervised Scorer + Anomaly Lane
    ScoringEngine->>ScoringEngine: Decision Calibrator

    alt High Risk
        ScoringEngine-->>Gateway: Action: Deny
        Gateway-->>User: 403 Forbidden
    else Medium Risk
        ScoringEngine-->>Gateway: Action: Challenge
        Gateway-->>User: 401 Unauthorized + CAPTCHA token
    else Low Risk
        ScoringEngine-->>Gateway: Action: Allow
        Gateway-->>User: 200 OK
    end

    ScoringEngine-)AuditStream: Async Log Decision (score, action, reasons)
